en:
Meow~
(Casting the spell to translate into human speech is getting tiring,
let's talk again later!)

Meow~
(Casting the spell to translate into human speech is getting tiring,
let's chat again tomorrow!)

If I had never been born,
if I weren't blonde,
none of this would have happened.

(I can't fully trust the Prime Minister,
if Maret is on his side,
what am I supposed to do then?)

"Then may I ask—under the current system,
if the research causes actual harm,
which body would bear responsibility?"

\V[108], um...
if you don't mind,
you can jump up on me.
